   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Each police robot "P-Guard" is equipped with VIVOTEK most iconic 180Â° panoramic network camera MS9390-HV to deliver 360Â° zero blind-spot surround imagery while patrolling on the street. Photo credit: ENOVA Robotics</rdf:li>
